I want two liters of your blood.

00:14:03.390 --> 00:14:06.220
You dare to draw blood from a vampire?

00:14:06.220 --> 00:14:08.310
What kind of doctor are you?

00:14:08.310 --> 00:14:12.940
A vampire is scared to give 
a mere two liters of blood?

00:14:12.940 --> 00:14:13.980
Have you no shame?

00:14:13.980 --> 00:14:18.120
Then perhaps I'll sip on 
some of yours like wine.

00:14:18.120 --> 00:14:20.800
There's a proper order to these things.

00:14:20.800 --> 00:14:23.010
You can do it, both of you.

00:14:30.040 --> 00:14:30.940
My son—

00:14:30.940 --> 00:14:34.490
rather, my daughter, I have returned.

00:14:35.190 --> 00:14:36.150
Dad!

00:14:37.860 --> 00:14:41.480
You weren't at home, 
so I figured you'd be here.

00:14:44.150 --> 00:14:44.990
Huh?

00:14:45.440 --> 00:14:49.500
You're Gilles de Rais, 
Gillesde Rais the vampire.

00:14:49.500 --> 00:14:55.300
And you're Van Helsink, the University 
of Helsink's Professor Bamba.

00:14:55.300 --> 00:14:57.650
Don't speak in such an 
obviously expository manner.

00:14:57.650 --> 00:14:58.680
The same goes for you.

00:14:58.680 --> 00:15:01.660
What? You two know each other?!

00:15:01.920 --> 00:15:05.130
Indeed. I've found you at last.

00:15:05.370 --> 00:15:08.470
We're destined to be rivals.

00:15:08.470 --> 00:15:09.340
Rivals?

00:15:09.620 --> 00:15:10.800
Let's go, Rais!

00:15:10.800 --> 00:15:12.520
Bring it on, Bam!

00:15:22.230 --> 00:15:24.690
Hold it right there.

00:15:25.000 --> 00:15:29.890
Could you wait to turn this man into 
ash until after I've drawn his blood?

00:15:29.890 --> 00:15:31.190
Who are you?

00:15:31.190 --> 00:15:33.450
She's my school doctor.

00:15:33.690 --> 00:15:34.850
Here I come.

00:15:40.950 --> 00:15:43.660
Looks like you're not 
completely incompetent.

00:15:47.820 --> 00:15:49.550
I-Incredible!

00:15:49.550 --> 00:15:50.750
Her thighs!

00:15:54.470 --> 00:15:56.850
Who is this woman?

00:15:56.850 --> 00:15:59.440
Your blood is mine, vampire.

00:15:59.760 --> 00:16:02.260
You won't get any of my blood, 
you blood drawing wench.

00:16:02.260 --> 00:16:06.910
Don't act like you haven't sucked 
the blood from countless people.

00:16:06.910 --> 00:16:10.280
Donating your own blood every 
once in a while won't hurt you.

00:16:10.280 --> 00:16:13.500
I wouldn't be a vampire 
if I feared retribution.

00:16:13.500 --> 00:16:18.340
Once I finish off this priest, you're next.

00:16:18.340 --> 00:16:20.690
Has your personality changed?

00:16:20.690 --> 00:16:24.280
Who changes personality and copyright 
infringing reference mid-fight?

00:16:24.280 --> 00:16:28.160
Gold-bugs!

00:16:37.810 --> 00:16:40.740
Such flashy techniques 
won't work against him.

00:16:40.740 --> 00:16:43.390
Let's settle this, Gilles de Rais.

00:17:12.130 --> 00:17:13.370
Where are the terrorists?

00:17:13.370 --> 00:17:15.840
Shoot everyone who puts up a fight!

00:17:28.150 --> 00:17:29.800
How regrettable.

00:17:30.140 --> 00:17:34.400
I thought I'd finally have my revenge 
tonight, after so many years.

00:17:34.400 --> 00:17:36.330
Your injuries were shallow.

00:17:36.330 --> 00:17:37.700
You deserve your disappointment.

00:17:38.030 --> 00:17:40.530
It's your fault for interfering!

00:17:40.530 --> 00:17:44.120
Damn it. I was so close to killing him.

00:17:44.120 --> 00:17:47.210
Why do you guys hate each other so much?

00:17:47.210 --> 00:17:50.410
What happened between the two of you?

00:17:50.410 --> 00:17:55.310
My great-uncle, my mother's cousin, 
and my father's second cousin

00:17:55.310 --> 00:18:00.080
and my father's second cousin were all 
staked by this man and turned to dust.

00:18:00.630 --> 00:18:03.560
I'll kill your entire family.

00:18:03.560 --> 00:18:05.320
What was that?!

00:18:05.320 --> 00:18:06.980
You wanna fight?!

00:18:06.310 --> 00:18:08.090
You can do it, both of you.

00:18:08.090 --> 00:18:09.620
Don't cheer them on.

00:18:09.620 --> 00:18:13.290
Calm down, you old farts.

00:18:13.290 --> 00:18:17.480
I, Doctor Chihiro Chimidoro, 
shall humbly handle this situation.

00:18:17.480 --> 00:18:19.700
I won't let a mere doctor handle this!

00:18:19.700 --> 00:18:21.240
Stay out of this, outsider!

00:18:21.240 --> 00:18:22.930
Idiots!

00:18:21.240 --> 00:18:27.210
<b>SLAP SLAP SLAP</b>

00:18:22.930 --> 00:18:24.640
I'm not an outsider!

00:18:24.640 --> 00:18:27.210
I'm Mai's guardian while she's 
living in this country!

00:18:27.730 --> 00:18:30.100
<i>I know she doesn't mean that.</i>

00:18:30.100 --> 00:18:32.420
<i>Older women are scary.</i>

00:18:33.050 --> 00:18:35.450
Who's an older woman?

00:18:35.450 --> 00:18:38.250
I didn't say that.

00:18:39.160 --> 00:18:43.660
How could you inflict your old 
grudge on these young girls?

00:18:43.660 --> 00:18:46.400
What terribly unreasonable behavior.

00:18:46.610 --> 00:18:50.060
Furthermore, if you attempt to 
destroy the beautiful fellowship

00:18:50.060 --> 00:18:54.850
that has formed in this country 
between human and vampire...

00:18:56.520 --> 00:19:01.680
I'll make sure you pay for it.

00:19:02.050 --> 00:19:05.090
Doctor, I hate to interrupt when 
you're clearly so excited,

00:19:05.090 --> 00:19:07.210
but they're not listening to you.

00:19:07.210 --> 00:19:08.400
Die!

00:19:08.400 --> 00:19:10.160
Nonsense!

00:19:10.160 --> 00:19:14.890
You middle-aged delinquents, 
you've got some gall!

00:19:14.270 --> 00:19:15.220
Bastard!

00:19:18.240 --> 00:19:21.200
Now, if you'll excuse me...

00:19:24.670 --> 00:19:27.990
I can never let my guard down around her.

00:19:36.900 --> 00:19:40.280
<i>And so, our long night ended.</i>

00:19:42.450 --> 00:19:45.350
What do you think you're 
doing while I've been gone?

00:19:45.800 --> 00:19:51.120
You're living with a vampire, of all things.

00:19:58.200 --> 00:19:59.710
Such a cute girl—

00:19:59.710 --> 00:20:02.290
I mean, how wretched.

00:20:08.250 --> 00:20:09.780
Shut up!

00:20:09.780 --> 00:20:15.790
A father who leaves his home to wander the 
world has no right to tell me what to do!

00:20:15.790 --> 00:20:19.140
This is why Mom cheated on and left you!

00:20:19.140 --> 00:20:20.410
Are you listening?

00:20:20.410 --> 00:20:27.270
Your broad-minded father will pretend he 
didn't hear those fatal words you just spoke.

00:20:28.180 --> 00:20:31.660
<i>I really do have a terrible family.</i>

00:20:32.010 --> 00:20:35.550
<i>Well, whatever. Mai is my family now.</i>

00:20:35.550 --> 00:20:37.730
What kind of nonsense is that?

00:20:37.730 --> 00:20:38.990
I won't allow it!

00:20:38.990 --> 00:20:41.340
We're kicking that girl out immediately!

00:20:41.340 --> 00:20:44.710
<i>No way. I'm never leaving Mai.</i>

00:20:44.710 --> 00:20:47.870
I'm the head of this household! 
I won't allow it!

00:20:47.870 --> 00:20:49.570
I'm the head of this household!

00:20:49.570 --> 00:20:54.090
No enemy of humanity will 
be part of my family!

00:20:57.400 --> 00:20:59.550
Hello, Bat Delivery Service here.

00:20:59.550 --> 00:21:01.310
I'm here to pick up and deliver a package.

00:21:01.310 --> 00:21:02.660
Pick up and deliver?

00:21:02.660 --> 00:21:05.760
I've been asked to deliver one 
coffin by cash on delivery.

00:21:05.760 --> 00:21:08.590
A coffin? I didn't place that order.

00:21:08.590 --> 00:21:12.440
It says here that it was 
ordered by a Doctor Chihiro.

00:21:12.440 --> 00:21:13.510
Chihiro?

00:21:13.510 --> 00:21:18.290
<i>I see. She wanted to get Mai's dad 
away from mine while he's asleep.</i>

00:21:18.290 --> 00:21:20.240
I'll be taking this.

00:21:35.780 --> 00:21:37.560
Romania, huh?

00:21:37.560 --> 00:21:41.590
All right. I'll beat him 
there and finish him off.

00:21:42.230 --> 00:21:45.490
What? Wait, Dad!

00:21:45.490 --> 00:21:47.690
Remember this, my daughter.

00:21:47.690 --> 00:21:51.820
Vampires are enemies of humanity.

00:21:51.820 --> 00:21:54.880
Your friendship shall never pay off!

00:22:05.350 --> 00:22:08.960
<i>Your friendship shall never pay off!</i>

00:23:44.980 --> 00:23:59.990
<b>Episode 6 "Castle of Vania"</b>

00:23:45.790 --> 00:23:48.890
Mai will play Dracula, lady of the castle.

00:23:48.890 --> 00:23:52.850
Vampire hunter Simon Belmond will 
be played by Bamban Mitsugu.

00:23:52.850 --> 00:23:55.910
Block 1 boss Franken will 
be played by Katsuno.

00:23:53.580 --> 00:23:58.580
The night school shall participate in the 
school festival by putting on a play.

00:23:55.910 --> 00:23:58.580
Block 2 boss Medusa will be played by Nami.
